d}| \\\\  & =0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & 8 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}|-(-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & 8 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}|+(-{k}^{2})\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0+(2\\cdot 5-(-1)\\cdot 8)-{k}^{2}(2\\cdot (-1)-(-1)\\cdot 4) \\\\  & =18-2{k}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThree vectors are coplanar if and only if their triple product is zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\cdot (q\\times r) & =0 \\\\ 18-2{k}^{2} & =0 \\\\ 2{k}^{2} & =18 \\\\ {k}^{2} & =9 \\\\ k & =\\pm 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the three vectors are coplanar if and only if $k=-3$ or $k=3.$" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348603 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348604 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348605 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348606 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348607 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1041 "selection" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348605 13194139535425 true] [17592186348602 1110 #uuid "675d7932-f3f5-5edb-9e6d-615469e579ac" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348603 1034 "k=-2,k=2" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348603 1111 #uuid "bc06fc4f-c7fc-5893-b461-e459ca368289" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348604 1034 "k=3" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348604 1111 #uuid "3615ddb6-e41f-5ac3-a45a-3ea8d821b22b" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348605 1034 "k=-3,k=3" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348605 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348605 1111 #uuid "71fd57f9-e530-5a97-b60c-4a731a184abf" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348606 1034 "k=-1,k=1" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348606 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348606 1111 #uuid "f3182a92-607d-5d08-b485-57ccb8fa8949" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348607 1034 "k=-3" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348607 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348607 1111 #uuid "63239bfa-abc2-5456-b72c-36c1ad52197d" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348608 1017 #edb/ref 17592186348609 13194139535425 true] [17592186348608 1089 "q-280314" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348608 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535425 true] [17592186348608 1100 "Calculate the volume $V$ of the parallelepiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD},$ given the points $A(1,0,-2),$ $B(3,-2,1),$ $C(-1,4,-1),$ and $D(2,1,0).$\n\n$V=${{field-1}}" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348608 1113 #uuid "66da7212-a246-5e38-9a80-39fb6123472c" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348608 1145 "First, we find the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ that span the parallelepiped:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =b-a \\\\  & =(3i-2j+k)-(i-2k) \\\\  & =2i-2j+3k \\\\  & =⟨2,-2,3⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =c-a \\\\  & =(-i+4j-k)-(i-2k) \\\\  & =-2i+4j+k \\\\  & =⟨-2,4,1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AD} & =d-a \\\\  & =(2i+j)-(i-2k) \\\\  & =i+j+2k \\\\  & =⟨1,1,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to find the volume of the parallelepiped, we need to take the absolute value of the triple product of the above vectors.\n\nComputing the triple product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot (\\overset{\\to }{AC}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AD}) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|-(-2)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|+3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(8-1)+2(-4-1)+3(-2-4) \\\\  & =14-10-18 \\\\  & =-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of the corresponding parallelpiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ is\n\n$$\nV=|-14|=14.\n$$" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348609 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348610 13194139535425 true] [17592186348609 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535425 true] [17592186348609 1041 "field-1" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348609 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348610 13194139535425 true] [17592186348609 1110 #uuid "da4b8e6a-7733-570c-8e3a-1ee5268d7268" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348610 1034 "14" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348610 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348610 1111 #uuid "b8f92c8b-a6ca-5197-8ba2-88d0ec9022bc" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348611 1017 #edb/ref 17592186348612 13194139535425 true] [17592186348611 1089 "q-73748" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348611 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535425 true] [17592186348611 1100 "Calculate the volume of the parallelepiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$, $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$, given the points $A(2,-1,0)$, $B(-1,2,-1)$, $C(1,1,2)$, and $D(3,-1,1).$" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348611 1113 #uuid "17da1f0b-bc64-50f2-8f48-1593c355e2c5" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348611 1145 "First, we find the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ that span the parallelepiped:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =b-a \\\\  & =(-i+2j-k)-(2i-j) \\\\  & =-3i+3j-k \\\\  & =⟨-3,3,-1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =c-a \\\\  & =(i+j+2k)-(2i-j) \\\\  & =-i+2j+2k \\\\  & =⟨-1,2,2⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AD} & =d-a \\\\  & =(3i-j+k)-(2i-j) \\\\  & =i+k \\\\  & =⟨1,0,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to find the volume of the parallelepiped, we need to take the absolute value of the triple product of the above vectors.\n\nComputing the triple product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot (\\overset{\\to }{AC}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AD}) & =|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|-3\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|+(-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-3(2\\cdot 1-0\\cdot 2)-3((-1)\\cdot 1-1\\cdot 2)-((-1)\\cdot 0-1\\cdot 2) \\\\  & =-6+9+2 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of the corresponding parallelpiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ is\n\n$$\nV=|\\,5\\,|=5.\n$$" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348613 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348614 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348615 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348616 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348617 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1041 "selection" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348617 13194139535425 true] [17592186348612 1110 #uuid "945d7554-314d-5b49-9757-96fb4bb8caea" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348613 1034 "11" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348613 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348613 1111 #uuid "a967dc66-0118-5493-ba6b-ed185a2f39b5" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348614 1034 "7" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348614 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348614 1111 #uuid "a1619f76-7ca5-5fae-9492-f532ebca3b3f" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348615 1034 "17" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348615 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348615 1111 #uuid "cfb08fc4-d8a3-54d5-bb54-a1c75677494d" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348616 1034 "1" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348616 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [17592186348616 1111 #uuid "3527c645-e657-5c5b-91b7-8aafa5c18edb" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348617 1034 "5" 13194139535425 true] [17592186348617 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535425 true] [1